DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-15T23:00:00&endDate=2026-08-17T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Sunday 16 August\, no service between Wandsworth Road and Clapham Junction. Trains will divert to/from Battersea Park after Wandsworth Road. Use local buses via any reasonable route between Clapham Junction and Battersea Park / Surrey Quays or Southern trains between Battersea Park and Clapham Junction\, where tickets will be accepted. In addition\, the early Sunday morning train at 0001 from Highbury & Islington to Battersea Park will not run.
